SUMMARY:Reference Solutions: Business Development Lunch & Learn
DESCRIPTION:Reference Solutions by Data Axle (formerly known as 
 ReferenceUSA) is a comprehensive research and reference database used for 
 finding detailed information on businesses and consumers. This tool is 
 available for free through the West Orange Public Library.\n\nIn this Lunch 
 & Learn session\, you will learn:\n\n\n	To access Data Axle Reference 
 Solutions from home or office through the West Orange Public Library\n	How 
 to identify new sales prospects\n	Create customized business and consumer 
 marketing lists\n	Identify key business contacts\n	Locate home-based 
 businesses\n	Find businesses with web addresses\n	Define delivery 
 routes\n	Gather competitive business intelligence\n	Identify major industry 
 groups\n
LOCATION:West Orange - Community Room 1\, West Orange Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="West Orange Library":MAILTO:events@westorange.bccls.org
CATEGORIES:
UID:LibCal-10341-16699378
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/16699378
END:VEVENT
