DESCRIPTION:Place the student's name and grade in the grade 
 field.\n\nDuring the session\, kids create and decorate their own special 
 bags using custom wooden blocks and vibrant\, child-safe paints. It is a 
 wonderful\, tactile way for children to learn a traditional art form\, 
 express their creativity\, and take home a beautiful utility piece they 
 made themselves.\n\nParent/caregiver will need to be present in the 
 children's room of the library but not necessary in the classroom. \n\n
