DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to 
 register.\n\nIn these creative writing sessions\, we will study poems and 
 share lively conversation\, motivation\, strategies\, writing prompts\, and 
 feedback. This will be oriented toward writing poems but may invite other 
 possibilities as well. \n\nCome ready to play and experiment with language 
 & ideas. Bring an open heart\, an open mind\, your adventurous spirit\, and 
 whatever you like to write with: pencil and paper\, laptop\, or 
 phone.\n\nAll levels of experience welcome. \n
