BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Thespaceforart": "https://thespaceforart.com/event/acrylic-pouring-workshop-with/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:thespaceforart
X-SOURCE:The Space For Art
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261006T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261006T160000
DTSTAMP:20260929T032346Z
CREATED:20260712T145433Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260929T032346Z
UID:9867-1791291600-1791302400@thespaceforart.com
SUMMARY:Acrylic Pouring Workshop with Mohanima
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an in-person\, 1 day workshop where you will learn fluid art techniques for acrylic paints. This is a lively and fun\, hands-on art making experience for all ages.  Learn how to prepare your paints with various pouring mediums that when processed with a hair dryer\, reveal the most unexpected and beautiful abstract art. \nYour teacher\, Rakhi of Mohanima Art\, will guide you through the whole process.  You can watch videos of the process on her Instagram. \nDiscussion on how to put a protective finish on your piece will also be covered. \nAll materials will be provide so just bring your fabulous self.  Each participant will create their own unique work of art. \nTuesday\, October 6\, 1 – 4 pm \nPrice: $150\n(Incl all supplies) \nTo purchase tickets go to their website page here – after signing up you will be taken to the ticket page to complete purchase.
URL:https://thespaceforart.com/event/acrylic-pouring-workshop-with/
LOCATION:the Space\, 356 Bloomfield Ave\, Montclair\, New Jersey\, 07042
CATEGORIES:Art
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://thespaceforart.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Screenshot-2026-07-12-at-10.53.25-AM-e1783868057673.png
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Jccmetrowest": "https://jccmetrowest.org/event/health-hormones/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:jccmetrowest
X-SOURCE:JCC MetroWest
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261006T133000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261006T143000
DTSTAMP:20261003T010243
CREATED:20260515T181002Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260519T145403Z
UID:10004713-1791293400-1791297000@jccmetrowest.org
SUMMARY:Women’s Health and Hormones Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Your sleep has changed. Your energy isn’t the same. Your body feels different.\nAlthough your doctor says everything is normal\, it doesn’t feel that way. \nJoin Dee Pentyala\, Ayurvedic Health Counselor and Wellness Practitioner\, for an immersive\, hands-on workshop where you’ll have an honest conversation about your hormones-like estrogen\, progesterone\, cortisol\, and thyroid-in plain\, everyday language. Through guided discussion\, real-life tools\, and interactive exercises\, you’ll understand why your body is doing what it’s doing and leave with practical changes around food\, movement\, stress\, and sleep that you can start tomorrow. \nFree and open to the public / Registration required \nRegister\n  \nFor more information: Ellen Robertson\, erobertson@jccmetrowest.org or (973) 530-3415.
URL:https://jccmetrowest.org/event/health-hormones/
LOCATION:JCC MetroWest | Tepper Hall\, 760 Northfield Ave\, West Orange\, NJ\, 07052\, United States
CATEGORIES:Fitness,Wellness
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://jccmetrowest.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Womens-Health-and-Hormones_hero.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Ellen Robertson":MAILTO:erobertson@jccmetrowest.org
GEO:40.7674616;-74.2963088
