SUMMARY:Raising Readers (birth to 5 years old)
DESCRIPTION:Join us in activities to raise up lifelong readers! We’ll be 
 hearing stories\, singing songs and setting a strong foundation for 
 literacy skills. Exposing young children to read-alouds\, songs\, rhymes 
 and chants is an important stepping stone in becoming a reader. We will be 
 exploring a new theme each week. \n\n*** PLEASE NOTE*** This week's 
 storytime will be at the Judy Weston Garden in Watchung Park (weather 
 permitting). If there is inclement weather\, we will meet at the Main 
 Branch Storytime Room on the 3rd floor as usual.\n\n\nNo registration 
 required\; space is limited.
LOCATION:Montclair - Offsite\, Montclair Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Library":MAILTO:events@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Children's Programs, Storytime
