SUMMARY:Halloween Mocktail Mixology Class
DESCRIPTION:Thursday\, October 8 from 6:30 PM - 8:00 PM. \nPlease note: 
 Registration is limited to adult Nutley cardholders (18 ).\n\nJoin us for 
 an interactive Halloween Mocktail Mixology Class with Raven's Reserve where 
 participants will learn how to create delicious\, alcohol-free drinks using 
 fresh ingredients and simple techniques. This hands-on program includes 
 guided instruction\, engaging demonstrations\, and light interactive 
 activities\, making it a fun and educational experience for all skill 
 levels.\n\nSponsored by The Friends of the Nutley Public Library
LOCATION:Nutley - Stockton Room\, Nutley Free Public Library
