DESCRIPTION:Saturday\, October 10 at 11:00 AM\n\nThe Narrator is ready to 
 start the show\, but how is that supposed to happen when nobody else in the 
 cast has read the script and the costumes haven't even arrived yet?\n\nJoin 
 us for a very special performance from the Nutley Little Theatre! 
 \n\nRecommended for ages 3 and up. \n\nNo registration required.\n\nFor 
 more information\, visit nutleypubliclibrary.org or call 973-667-0405 ext. 
 2623.
