SUMMARY:Smartphones & Safe Seniors PART TWO
DESCRIPTION:Erin Taylor of The Silent Gen LLC returns to continue our 
 discussion on how to navigate modern mobile technology.  Questions are 
 welcome!\n\nKey topics include:\n\n\n	Learning to spot warning signs of 
 fraudulent text messages\n	Tech support for frozen screens and fake virus 
 warning pop-ups\n	Strategies to handle high-pressure imposter calls 
 demanding payment\n\n\nYou do not need to have attended "Part One" to 
 register for this session!\n\nRegistration is required and limited to 30 
 attendees.  You do not need to be a Nutley patron.  \n\nContact the 
 reference desk at 973-667-0405 ext. 2604 with any questions!
LOCATION:Nutley - Stockton Room\, Nutley Free Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Nutley Library":MAILTO:events@nutley.bccls.org
CATEGORIES:Special Event
UID:LibCal-10315-17725506
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/17725506
END:VEVENT
