SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261003T050245Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261011T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261011T180000
SUMMARY:Mount Vernon Trail Hike
DESCRIPTION:Metrotrails: NJ\, PA\, NY Metropolitan Area Hiking and More!\n
 Join us for this point to point hike\, the next in our 911 National Memori
 al Trail series\, this with the Mt Vernon Trail being the subject. The off
 icial trail map shows this as a part of it\, as a spur.\nThe trail is just
  over 17 miles\, so it fits perfectly what we do\, and after this one we'l
 l start heading back toward NYC.\nAfter meeting at the end point\, we'll s
 huttle with as few vehicles as possible to our start point.\nThe Mt Vernon
  Trail is pretty straightforward\, and follows the Potomac River the entir
 e time\, so it's really a great continuation from what we've already done 
 with the C&O.\nThis time I'm only planning on one day of hiking\, and migh
 t visit some museums the second day.\nIf needed\, contact me at 908 343 83
 74
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/metrotrails/events/316823217/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261003T024008Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261003T024008Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup North Jersey Bowling Soccer Volleyball": "https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleyball/events/315550836/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_north_jersey_bowling_soccer_volleyball
X-SOURCE:Meetup: NJ Bowling, Volleyball, Tennis & More
UID:event_315550836@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261003T050246Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261011T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261011T120000
SUMMARY:Weekend Warrior Tennis (Sundays)
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis & More\nJoin us for
  friendly and sociable free rallies and possibly some informal matches for
  training and fun. We are beginner to intermediate levels but all are welc
 ome. We don’t allow formal instruction on our group-reserved courts\, al
 though giving some quick tips is OK so long as you’re not holding up oth
 ers waiting to play.\n\n⛑️ **Clinic Matches:** If we have to rotate pe
 ople in then we may play some clinic-style matches where everyone rotates 
 in evenly. There is no holding the court via wins so everyone has a chance
  to play regardless of skill level.\n\n🕊️ **Early Bird Start:** If yo
 u want to meet earlier than 9 AM (like 8 or 8:30) then please let us know 
 by the day before and we’ll see who can join you (usually I can do earli
 er).\n\n**🎾 Equipment:** Please bring your own racquet and water\, as w
 e don’t provide those. I always have some balls for at least one court\,
  but feel free to bring your own in case we need to branch out over more t
 han one court.\n\n**🧯DISCLAIMER:** Courts are subject to availability a
 nd weather. If you make plans to attend please be prepared to cancel or ad
 just our location as needed. Furthermore\, by attending you agree to be fu
 lly responsible for your own health and safety. Each person is responsible
  to take a break for rest and water at their own discretion.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/315550836/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260704T234158Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260704T234158Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
