DESCRIPTION:CUS for Paws is a community service event where participants c
 an earn 1 service hour for every 2 donated items (up to 2 hours maximum) 
 to support a local animal shelter. The event will highlight three animal 
 welfare organizations and educate attendees on the importance of being a 
 voice for animals that cannot speak for themselves. Join the Cussies as w
