LOCATION:University Hall\, 7th Floor Conference Center
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:New Jersey's 44th Annual Law School Day
UID:https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12564033
URL:https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12564033
