DESCRIPTION:Hang out and have casual conversations with other students whi
 le enjoying refreshments! Join us on Wednesdays from 2:30-3:30pm. \nWhat 
 are Fireside Chats:\n\nA space for students to meet\, connect\, and have 
 a casual conversation about a given topic\, or anything else that feels c
