SUMMARY:Film Club - In-Person
DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School multi-week class. Click here to 
 register.\n\nDo you love to go to the movies and discuss them? See selected 
 movies which are mostly art/indie and Oscar-nominated films at the 
 Clairidge Theater in Montclair. Then join classmates at Congregation 
 Shomrei Emunah in Montclair to talk about themes\, plot\, characters\, 
 acting\, directing\, cinematography\, costumes\, score\, trailers and 
 viewer’s expectations.\n\nClass dates: Sep. 23\, Oct. 14\, Oct. 28\, Nov. 
 11\, Dec. 2\n
