 Public Library!\nHosted by the Montclair Public Library Foundation and 
 Friends of the Montclair Public Library.\n\n \n\nPricing:\n\n\n	\n	Coffee 
 table/ Art books: $4\n	\n	\n	Adult hardcover: $3\n	\n	\n	Adult paperback: 
 $1\n	\n	\n	Adult mass market: 2/$1\n	\n	\n	Children’s hardcover: 
 $2\n	\n	\n	Children’s paperback: 
 2/$1\n	\n	\n	DVDs/Blu-rays/Audiobooks/CDs $2\n	\n	\n	BAG DAY: fill a bag 
 for $10\n	\n\n\n \n\nLearn more here.
