UID:10381-1792836000-1792843200@thespaceforart.com
SUMMARY:The Balanced Woman Blueprint:  Wellness Reset for Women 40+
DESCRIPTION:RESET is a two-hour wellness experience designed for women 40+ who are ready to stop running on autopilot and start making intentional decisions about what comes next.\n\n\nSaturday\, October 24\, 10am – 12noon\, $45 \nGet clear about what you want. Make bold decisions about what comes next. Leave with a practical plan to reclaim your life. \nYou’ve spent years showing up for your career\, your family\, your relationships\, and the people who depend on you. \nYou’re capable. You’re responsible. You get things done. \nBut somewhere along the way\, you may have become the last person on your own list. \nAnd maybe you’re asking yourself: \n\nWhat do I actually want now?\nWhat needs to change?\nWhat do I want this next chapter to look like?Led by Sakirat Oladiran\, NP\, Board-Certified Nurse Practitioner and Certified Life & Health Coach\, RESET combines guided reflection\, meditation\, meaningful conversation\, and practical exercises to help you step back\, get clear\, and create a plan for moving forward. \nYour RESET Starts Here Reserve your seat today! \nTogether\, we’ll explore five areas that shape how you experience your life: \nBODY — Reconnect with your health\, energy\, and well-being.\nMIND — Quiet the mental overload and create clarity.\nJOY — Rediscover what makes you feel alive.\nRELATIONSHIPS — Strengthen connections and create healthier boundaries.\nPURPOSE — Get clear about what you want from this next chapter. \nYou’ll Leave With: \nA clearer understanding of what you truly want\nGreater confidence to make intentional decisions\nPractical strategies for creating more balance\nA personalized plan for your next steps\nRenewed energy to move forward without losing yourself in the process \nThis isn’t about adding more to your already-full plate. \nIt’s about deciding what deserves a place on it. \nEVENT DETAILS \nSaturday\, October 24 | 10:00 AM–12:00 PM\nThe Space • Montclair\, NJ \n\n356 Bloomfield Ave\, loft #2 and\n\n5 S Willow St\, second floor (there are 2 entrances) \nFood & beverages included\nIntimate\, interactive experience\nLimited attendance \nTickets: $45 + applicable Eventbrite fees \nTwo hours. Five areas of your life. One opportunity to decide what comes next. \nYou’ve invested in your career.\nYou’ve invested in your family.\nYou’ve invested in everyone around you. \nNow it’s time to invest in YOU. \nCome to RESET ready to reconnect with yourself—and leave ready to move forward. \nReserve your seat today! \n\n\n\nThe Space is located on the second floor of a historic building with no elevator.  Unfortunately we are unable to accommodate those with limited mobility.
URL:https://thespaceforart.com/event/the-balanced-woman-blueprint-wellness-reset-for-women-40/
LOCATION:the Space\, 356 Bloomfield Ave\, Montclair\, New Jersey\, 07042
CATEGORIES:Wellness
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://thespaceforart.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/46-e1789509286726.jpeg
END:VEVENT
