SUMMARY:Kip's Castle: An Eerie and Opulent Mansion NEW
DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to 
 register.\n\nWhen is a house more than a home?  When it's a castle!  
 Maressa MacFarlane\, archivist of the Essex County Parks system\, will 
 cover the history of Kip's Castle\, the only one in Essex County\, and some 
 of its surprising uses over the last 120 years. Set in eleven acres of 
 parkland\, Kip's Castle straddles Montclair and Verona and provides 
 spectacular views of New York City.
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Auditorium\, Montclair Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Adult School":MAILTO:adultschool@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Adult School, Lectures / History & Culture
UID:LibCal-10306-17220549
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/17220549
END:VEVENT
