SUMMARY:Writing Personal Essays
DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to 
 register.\n\nExpress yourself within the framework of this classic genre. 
 Each week has a different theme: place\, humor\, social issues\, tributes. 
 Be prepared to do 30-60 minutes a week of reading of work by master 
 essayists (instructor will email documents a few days in advance of class).
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Conference Room\, Montclair Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Adult School":MAILTO:adultschool@montclairlibrary.org
