 start at a very basic level of learning & playing).  All students are 
 committed to attend all 3 classes.  Seats are limited to 16 students.  Sets 
 and cards will be provided.\n\nThere is a $30 registration fee that can be 
 paid in cash or check at the Reference Desk.\n\nPlease register here and 
 then complete your payment in person.
