SUMMARY:Spiritual Enrichment Group: Advent Program
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261123T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261123T203000
DTSTAMP:20261003T050240Z
UID:108khhn40p29is96h1irb4331t@google.com__20261123
SEQUENCE:1
CREATED:20260921T183409Z
DESCRIPTION:Our <b>Spiritual Enrichment Group </b>is now meeting on the <b
 >third Monday of the month at 7pm via Zoom</b>. For many years we met at 1
 1:45am (originally in-person and since the pandemic) via Zoom. In Spring 2
 026\, Reverend Katherine sent the following message to our Church lay lead
 ers: "<span><span><span>Coffee</span></span></span> <span><span><span>hour
 </span></span></span> is growing and newcomers are still walking through 
 our doors. It is the <b>only time that clergy has an opportunity to intera
 c</b>t and be available to the congregation. Hanging around during clean u
 p is a further opportunity as well. Exiting into an office with a closed d
 oor does not seem appropriate anymore."<br><br>And so\, members of the Sp
 iritual Enrichment Group agreed to try meeting on Monday evenings\; we use
  the <b>Sunday Morning Worship Zoom Link</b>. In certain seasons\, we'll h
 ost a more regular (weekly) gathering using an agreed upon program. If you
  have any questions\, speak with Reverend Katherine.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260921T200023Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:Church of the Holy Spirit Verona
END:VEVENT
