UID:jvrobskj5ffhj5tsts4tiivu50_R20230114T140000@google.com__20261212
SEQUENCE:5
CREATED:20200910T224851Z
DESCRIPTION:The UUCM Men’s Group welcomes everyone who identifies as mal
 e to share mutual support and discussions about our lives\, triumphs\, and
  struggles. All are welcome to gather to receive and provide support on th
 e 2nd Saturday of every month at 9 AM. <a href="mailto:mensgroup@uumontcla
 ir.org">Contact for more information. </a><br><br /><br>UUCM A is invitin
