SUMMARY:Authors' Discussion Group
DESCRIPTION:Meet with fellow book authors - both those who have already 
 published and those who have not yet - to chat about process\, offer 
 support\, gain feedback\, and share insights on the publishing industry.
LOCATION:Nutley - Stockton Room
ORGANIZER;CN="Nutley Library":MAILTO:events@nutley.bccls.org
CATEGORIES:Club
UID:LibCal-10315-17482285
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/17482285
